508
00:29:47,600 --> 00:29:49,140
Oh, good, I'm not dead.

509
00:29:52,900 --> 00:29:54,040
Hello, dear lady.

510
00:29:54,200 --> 00:29:55,857
Allow me to help you to your feet.

511
00:29:55,940 --> 00:29:57,220
Oh, thank you.

512
00:29:57,320 --> 00:29:58,817
Nice day, don't you think?

513
00:29:58,900 --> 00:30:00,440
Hey, we need a favor.

514
00:30:04,160 --> 00:30:05,000
Whiskey Peak?

515
