back before you bothered to tell us?

545
00:31:04,440 --> 00:31:06,160
Oh, sorry. I forgot.

546
00:31:06,380 --> 00:31:08,380
Crocus gave us his Log Pose, so...

547
00:31:09,400 --> 00:31:11,200
