563
00:31:38,860 --> 00:31:40,760
Okay, it's time we get going!

564
00:31:41,800 --> 00:31:45,297
Now that me and Laboon have an understanding,
I can leave with a clear conscience.

565
00:31:45,380 --> 00:31:48,145
