567
00:31:50,240 --> 00:31:52,887
Oh, i'm the man who'll
be king of the pirates

568
00:31:57,200 --> 00:31:58,840
Not too bright, this one

569
00:32:00,340 --> 00:32:04,457
Should be good to go The Log Pose
has had plenty of time to store the

570
