route The needle should be pointing
in the same direction as the map.

571
00:32:09,520 --> 00:32:11,814
It's pointing directly to Whiskey Peak.

572
00:32:12,000 --> 00:32:13,000
See ya, Pops!

573
00:32:13,100 --> 00:32:14,777
Thanks again for the lock pose!

574
00:32:14,860 --> 00:32:15,690
Take care!

575
00:32:15,773 --> 00:32:17,211
Have a safe trip, my boy!

576
00:32:17,340 --> 00:32:18,281
