We'll start again, this time round.

597
00:33:54,820 --> 00:33:57,960
We'll build a stronger love.

598
00:33:59,880 --> 00:34:02,617
Oh, you've got me heart and soul.

599
00:34:02,700 --> 00:34:07,237
I just wanna hold you and not let go.

600
00:34:07,320 --> 00:34:12,000
You know that I'll be with
you till the end of time.

